### independent-host

【仅限独立站点】设置独立站点域名（独立站点必开启此扩展点），根据域名匹配独立站点

(https://alidocs.oss-cn-zhangjiakou.aliyuncs.com/lark/https://yuque.antfin.com/def-work/doc_v3/qar8k46ggp1o6f4g/imgJfpNF8nWcD.png)


#### Config

```
{
  "domain": {
    "prod": "fbi-o2.alibaba-inc.com", 
    "pre": "pre-fbi-o2.alibaba-inc.com"
  }
}

```


